2.2 Justification of the Enterprise
The enterprise was selected because:
•	Indigenous chicken meat has a high market demand.
•	Birds adapt well to the climatic conditions of Limuru.
•	They are relatively hardy and more disease tolerant.
•	They require moderate capital investment.
•	They provide quick returns compared to larger livestock.
•	Poultry manure provides an additional income source.
•	Students gain practical livestock management skills.
•	The enterprise promotes climate-smart agriculture.
